  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSTRUCTION OF PRIMARY SCHOOLS AND MADRASAHS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS AT CONSTRUCT 200 PRIMARY SCHOOLS AND 137 MADRASAHS IN DIFFERENT AREAS IN BANGLADESH TO FULFILL THE FOLLOWING ABJECTIVES : A) TO IMPROVE EDUCATIONAL ENVIRONMENT IN GOVERNMENT PRIMARY SCHOOLS AND MADRASAHS OF THE PROJECT AREA, B) TO MEET THE TARGETS OF THE 5TH FIVE YEAR PLAN (1998 _2003) WHICH HAS EMPHASIZED THE IMPORTANCE OF PRIMARY EDUCT.</narrative>
  </description>
